alt with inside one's community. Mental health impacts each one, irrespective of period, gender, or communal standing. Nevertheless, there represents even a prevalent stigma encircling mental health dilemmas that hinders multiple people from searching for the assistance they require. A single of the principal motives for this stigma is the deficiency of grasp and instruction regarding mental health. Numerous individuals nonetheless maintain antiquated convictions that mental health troubles constitute a marker of weakness or that individuals can just \"snap out of it.\" This mindset perpetuates the idea that seeking help for mental health issues is unnecessary or even shameful. It is important to raise awareness about mental health and educate society about the realities of these conditions. By understanding that mental health is just as important as physical health, we can start to break down the barriers that prevent individuals from seeking help. We need to promote empathy, compassion, and understanding towards those who are struggling with mental health issues. Reducing the stigma associated with mental health is crucial for the well-being of individuals and our society as a whole. By creating an inclusive and supportive environment, we can encourage open discussions about mental health, provide resources and support for those in need, and ultimately work towards a society that prioritizes mental well-being.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 25.97, "secret_key_generation": 122.43}, "decoding_time": 0.0008268356323242188, "decoded_message": "1100011010110001111000110011000110100101101000001011100000100000101111", "error_message": ""}